# 🚀 EaseFlow Dashboard

A modern full-stack task and project management dashboard built using React.js, Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB, and JWT Authentication.

EaseFlow helps teams organize projects, manage tasks, track progress, and collaborate efficiently through an interactive Kanban-style workflow system.

---

# ✨ Features

## 🔐 Authentication

* User Registration
* User Login
* JWT Token Authentication
* Protected Routes
* Logout Functionality

---

## 📋 Task Management

* Create Tasks
* Edit Tasks
* Delete Tasks
* Drag and Drop Task Movement
* Task Status Management
* Task Priority Levels
* Due Date Management

---

## 📌 Project Board

* Kanban-style Dashboard
* To Do, In Progress, Done Columns
* Interactive Task Cards
* Real-time UI Updates
* Smooth Drag-and-Drop Experience

---

## 👥 Team Management

* Team Members Page
* View All Members
* Remove Members
* User Role Display
* Admin Identification

---

## 💬 Comments & Activity

* Add Comments to Tasks
* Activity Tracking
* Task Discussion System

---

# 🎨 UI Features

* Responsive Design
