# 🛠️ Tech Stack

## Frontend

* React.js
* React Router DOM
* Axios
* @hello-pangea/dnd

## Backend

* Node.js
* Express.js

## Database

* MongoDB Atlas
* Mongoose

## Authentication

* JSON Web Token (JWT)

